        "x1": 249.1,
        "tag": "title",
        "text": "A Formal and informal words"
      },
      {
        "y": 88.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 369,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Some words are formal or informal, and others are quite neutral."
      },
      {
        "y": 100,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 440.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Is your partner (neutral) / other half (informal) not with you today? [husband/wife]"
      },
      {
        "y": 112,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 283.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Rick’s a really nice bloke/guy. [man; informal]"
