      {
        "y": 124,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 457.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "She is able to converse with everyone, which is a great gift. [have a conversation; formal]"
      },
      {
        "y": 140.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 472.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Sometimes it is possible to arrange words into sets of neutral, formal and informal words."
      },
      {
