      {
        "y": 256.8,
        "x0": 110.7,
        "x1": 205,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Language help"
      },
      {
        "y": 280.7,
        "x0": 111.7,
        "x1": 491.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Register is concerned with the overall tone of a text or conversation, and the relationship that is"
      },
      {
        "y": 293.1,
        "x0": 111.7,
        "x1": 492.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "built between the speaker and listener, or reader and writer. It is important to speak and write in"
      },
      {
        "y": 305.1,
        "x0": 111.7,
        "x1": 273.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "the appropriate register for the situation."
      },
      {
        "y": 338.2,
        "x0": 74.7,
        "x1": 205.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B Speech and writing"
      },
      {
        "y": 356.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 514.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Some words are more associated with either spoken or written language. It is worth noting if a word"
      },
      {
        "y": 368.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 377.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "has a particularly strong association with speech (S) or writing (W)."
      },
      {
        "y": 386.1,
        "x0": 105.1,
        "x1": 358.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "word/phrase S/W comment and example"
      },
      {
        "y": 400.4,
        "x0": 105.1,
        "x1": 469.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "subsequently W Linking adverb: (in speech, more likely to be ‘later’ or"
      },
      {
        "y": 411.7,
        "x0": 270.2,
        "x1": 484.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "‘afterwards’) e.g. The police found some important clues."
      },
      {
        "y": 422.4,
        "x0": 270.2,
        "x1": 432.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Subsequently, three people were arrested."
      },
