        "y": 436.8,
        "x0": 105.1,
        "x1": 492,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "in sum W Linking expression: means ‘to sum up’, e.g. In sum, we may"
      },
      {
        "y": 448.1,
        "x0": 270.2,
        "x1": 466.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "say that most, but not all, English adverbs end in -ly."
      },
      {
        "y": 462.2,
